### 1. 응답 설계 심화 - 회원 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/response/users

### 2. 응답 설계 심화 - query string 검색
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/response/users?status=active&name=고릴라

### 3. 응답 설계 심화 - 회원 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/response/users/1

### 4. 응답 설계 심화 - 201 Created + Location header
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/response/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "user04",
  "pwd": "pass04",
  "name": "신규회원",
  "status": "active"
}

### 회원 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/response/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "user01",
  "pwd": "changed",
  "name": "수정회원",
  "status": "active"
}

### 5. 응답 설계 심화 - 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/response/users/1

### 6. Bean Validation - 정상 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/validation/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "user01",
  "pwd": "pass01",
  "name": "홍길동",
  "enrollDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000+00:00"
}

### 7. Bean Validation - 필수 값 누락으로 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/validation/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pwd": "pass01",
  "name": "홍길동",
  "enrollDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000+00:00"
}

### 8. Bean Validation - 이름 공백으로 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/validation/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "user01",
  "pwd": "pass01111111111111111111111111111",
  "name": "",
  "enrollDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000+00:00"
}

### 9. 전역 예외 응답 - 존재하지 않는 회원으로 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/validation/users/999

### 10. Swagger 문서화 확인
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html

### 11. Swagger 대상 API - 회원 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/swagger/users

### 12. Swagger 대상 API - query string 검색
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/swagger/users?status=active&name=고릴라
